sequenceDiagram
 participant U as "외부 caller 현재 미연결"
 participant S as "F022 CalibrationSession"
 participant R as "F021 Runner"
 participant N as "borrowed A·owned B native"
 participant C as "AR 또는 CameraX"
 U->>S: "start current lease"
 S->>C: "전용 camera owner 확보"
 S->>R: "start 5분 budget"
 R->>N: "fixed·live native invocation"
 U->>S: "cancel/back/deadline"
 S->>R: "cancel intent 및 새 frame 차단"
 Note over R,N: "borrowed native 강제 interrupt 성공으로 drain ACK 만들지 않음"
 N-->>R: "실제 invocation 반환"
 R->>R: "Image 및 미인수 candidate close"
 alt "runner 정리 성공"
  R-->>S: "whenDrained"
  S->>C: "GL/analyzer barrier 뒤 실제 close/unbind"
  C-->>S: "AR close 또는 CameraState.CLOSED"
  S-->>U: "실제 drained ACK"
 else "native/image/camera close 실패"
  S->>S: "lease 유지, 새 camera owner 차단"
 end
